# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# um.exe is 60 KB with no dependencies, and the point of the thing is to be
# copied onto a USB stick or into a boot.wim at short notice. Having the built
# binary in the repo means you can grab it without a toolchain in front of you.
# If you would rather keep binaries out, add a line:  dist/

# Scratch dir used when a stale git lock had to be moved aside
# (device tooling cannot delete files, only move them).
_to_delete/
